<%# The DSFR card, written out rather than taken from `CardComponent`: that one
    renders a title, and the section around this card carries it — a card
    repeating the heading above it says the same thing twice.

    `lang` on the card and not on each label: every word this card writes is
    English — the labels, and the level the authentication reached — where the
    page it sits on declares French (RGAA 8.7). %>
<div class="fr-card fr-card--shadow fr-card--no-arrow identity-card fr-col-12 fr-col-md-8 fr-mb-4w" lang="en">
  <div class="fr-card__body">
    <div class="fr-card__content">
      <%# The artwork the DSFR gives a person, beside the civil identity and not
          beside the level under it: the level is what the authentication adds,
          and stands apart from what the user recognises themself by.
          Decorative — the heading above the card names it. %>
      <div class="pictogram-row">
        <%= render PictogramComponent.new(name: 'digital/avatar') %>

        <dl class="identity-card__attributes pictogram-row__wording">
          <% civil.each do |label, value| %>
            <div>
              <dt><%= label %></dt>
              <dd><%= value %></dd>
            </div>
          <% end %>
        </dl>
      </div>

      <% if level.present? || eidas_identifier %>
        <hr class="fr-mt-3w">

        <%# One line for what the authentication adds to the identity above —
            the level, label and value side by side, and the eIDAS identifier
            when there is one —: a column of its own would announce a list of
            one. `fr-badge` renders on
            a `<p>`, which the DSFR fixes — it is the tag its own examples carry,
            and the styles hang off it — so the line around it is a `<div>` and
            not a `<p>`. %>
        <div class="identity-card__level">
          <% if level.present? %>
            <span><%= level_label %></span>
            <p class="fr-badge fr-badge--sm"><%= level %></p>
          <% end %>
          <% if eidas_identifier %>
            <p class="identity-card__eidas fr-text--sm fr-text-mention--grey fr-mb-0"><%= eidas_identifier %></p>
          <% end %>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
